SUMMARY:Deadline: Postdoctoral Associates in AI in the Humanities and Socia
 l Sciences (Cornell University) 2027-2029
DESCRIPTION:A cohort of up to five two-year postdoctoral fellows working on
  AI from humanistic and social-science angles: social and cultural impacts
  of AI\, computational methods\, and the ethics\, politics and history of 
 AI.\n\nOrganisation: Cornell University\, College of Arts and Sciences\nLo
 cation: Ithaca\, New York\, USA\nAward: USD 70\,000 per year plus full ben
 efits and a USD 4\,000 annual research account (further funds by applicati
 on). No application fee.\nDuration: Two years\, 1 August 2027 to 31 July 2
 029\n\nMore: https://academicjobsonline.org/ajo/jobs/32791?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://academicjobsonline.org/ajo/jobs/32791?utm_source=artificialnouv
 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
